Third-party dependencies are consumed from npm and are not vendored into this
repository. Their licenses apply as published. Principal dependencies:

  react, react-dom              React
  vite                          Build tooling
  @apollo/client                GraphQL client
  ethers                        Ethereum client library
  @reown/appkit                 Wallet connection
  lightweight-charts            Price charts, by TradingView (Apache-2.0)
  primereact                    UI components
  tailwindcss                   Styling
  socket.io-client              WebSocket transport
  @fontsource-variable/red-hat-display   Red Hat Display font (SIL OFL 1.1)

Note on lightweight-charts: TradingView asks for attribution when using
Lightweight Charts. The chart is configured to display their attribution logo
(the default). If you disable it via the `attributionLogo` layout option, credit
TradingView elsewhere in your interface.

Review each package's terms before vendoring them, bundling them into a
redistributed artifact, or shipping a container image.
